    {
      "id": "VvFQSorJyTrZ2GNZVi3-E",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 556,
      "y": 187.5,
      "width": 952.959228515625,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 920576334,
      "version": 839,
      "versionNonce": 1793790030,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788002195691,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Clarify requirements:\n    - User can create group and add expenses on group with selection of users with total amount\n    - users should add expenses within group with amt, description, participants\n    - Split strategies - equal-split, exact-amt, percentage split\n    - User able see avaliables balances with other users to settle-up\n\n2.  Entities:\n    - SplitwiseService : add users, create groups and add users to groups, maintain balancesheet\n    - Groups: name, participants, expenses\n    - Expenses: id, name, total_amt, paid_by, participants, split_type\n    - Split: different types : Equal split, exact split, percentage split\n    - Balancesheet: 2D of user-user with balance amt\n\n3. Class Design:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Clarify requirements:\n    - User can create group and add expenses on group with selection of users with total amount\n    - users should add expenses within group with amt, description, participants\n    - Split strategies - equal-split, exact-amt, percentage split\n    - User able see avaliables balances with other users to settle-up\n\n2.  Entities:\n    - SplitwiseService : add users, create groups and add users to groups, maintain balancesheet\n    - Groups: name, participants, expenses\n    - Expenses: id, name, total_amt, paid_by, participants, split_type\n    - Split: different types : Equal split, exact split, percentage split\n    - Balancesheet: 2D of user-user with balance amt\n\n3. Class Design:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
